          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/kc-professional-sietske-hamelink.jpg",
            "heading": "Sietske Hamelink",
            "text": "Nutritional Practitioner, Menstrual Cycle Expert",
            "hover_text": "<p>“As a nutritional therapist specialized in female hormones, I’m extremely careful about what I put into my body. Hormones are sensitive. Stress, toxins, poor-quality ingredients — they all add up. So I don’t just look at labels, I look at what something will do inside the body.</p><p>I choose Karmicare because I trust what’s in it — and what’s not. No unnecessary fillers, no hidden disruptors. Just clean, purposeful ingredients that support rather than burden the nervous system and hormonal balance. When you understand how delicate the female endocrine system can be, especially under chronic stress, quality isn’t optional.</p><p>And that’s also why I use it in my practice.</p><p>I work with women dealing with PMS, cycle issues, stress-related fatigue, estrogen dominance and adrenal dysregulation. I need products that are technically sound — bioavailable, well-formulated, and supportive of detox pathways and nervous system regulation.</p><p>Karmicare fits that standard.”</p>"
          }
